        "title": "Construct a right triangle",
        "text": "Construct a right triangle with angle $$\\theta$$ so that $$\\tan(\\theta)=x/2.$$ \\n Assume a triangle with opposite side length $$x$$ and adjacent side $$2$$.\\n##figure1.gif##",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
