        ],
        "title": "SOHCAHTOA",
        "text": "$$\\text{Hypotenuse}$$ $$=\\sqrt{2^2+x^2}=\\sqrt{4+x^2}$$. Since $$\\sec(\\theta)=\\text{Hyp/Adj},$$ divide your result by $$2$$.\\n##figure2.gif##",
